# OpenTofu / Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# NOT .terraform.lock.hcl — that one is committed on purpose.
#
# It is the provider dependency lock, it holds no secrets, and OpenTofu asks
# for it to be tracked. Without it the version constraint in versions.tf
# floats, so an apply from another machine can silently pull a different
# provider minor than the one this configuration was written and tested
# against. All three site repos track it.

# Wrangler
.wrangler/

# Deploy artifacts
_site/

